        "text": "Wolfgang Amadeus Mozart's Don Giovanni, which premiered in Prague on October 29th, 1787. Celebrated since its opening, this opera features some of Mozart's most fascinating characters and memorable music: brilliant libretto, music where action moves forward, with trombones (= death and afterlife);",
