        "text": "They play ‘Non più andrai farfallone amoroso’ in Don Giovanni (from the Marriage of Figaro), servant who sings it was same singer who sang it in previous opera; Bondini Opera Company directed by Mr Gardassoni asked Mozart to write opera for them → he wrote their opera for those singers;",
